cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use cuDepthFusion in your work, please cite the software with the metadata below.
  Results on ICL-NUIM should also cite the dataset (see references).
type: software
title: "cuDepthFusion: pose-aware, edge-preserving temporal depth fusion"
abstract: >-
  Open-source temporal depth fusion that combines consecutive noisy depth frames with their
  camera poses to produce a more stable depth image in the current view, without dragging old
  surfaces across occlusions or moving foregrounds. A C++ reference implementation defines
  correctness, a CUDA backend makes it fast, and Python drives datasets, evaluation and demos.
authors:
